        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/{size}/1877_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-02-05T13:44:30.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"cnranger\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/53a042/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> cnranger:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Baptism by Fire and is <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#4</span> of 6.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Damn you're right! I've been calling it by the total wrong name. I really need to start double checking my info because it's clear my memory is fading faster than Bill Cosbys popularity</p>",
