      {
        "id": 158851,
        "name": "Maynes32",
        "username": "Maynes32",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/c5a1d2/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2016-02-05T16:02:50.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Just out of casual interest, it looks like the Baptism by Fire series is definitely a Fanatic/Ra team-up, at least partly against the Ennead. Issues show up in Fanatic's deck, Ra's, and The Ennead's. The only art that shows anyone else is Ra's Imbued Fire (Legacy) and Fanatic's Divine Sacrifice (Blade Battalion), which are issues 5 &amp; 6, respectively. It is possible that the presence of Legacy (as Baron Blade's nemesis) on Imbued Fire and Blade Battalion on Divine Sacrifice is indicative of Legacy (or Freedom Five) joining the team-up for a fight against Baron Blade in those last two issues.</p><p>With the art from (?) 5 &amp; 6, combined with the cover of BbF #4, it looks like #4 might be the dramatic conclusion of the Ennead story arc in BbF?</p><p>Back to cataloging art &amp; issue numbers,</p><p>BLM</p>",
        "post_number": 23,
        "post_type": 1,
